  "notes": "Source: Wyoming Secretary of State monthly 'Wyoming Voter Registration' Statewide Summary PDF (June 2026), retrieved from https://sos.wyo.gov/Elections/VRStats.aspx. Report breaks down registration by party: Constitution, Democratic, Libertarian, Republican, Unaffiliated, plus an 'Other' column (statewide 2,304) for individuals registered in parties no longer recognized in Wyoming. The 'Other' column is preserved in each county's by_party object but is excluded from statewide_by_party, which lists only the five currently recognized parties. statewide_total_registered (271,820) INCLUDES the 'Other' registrants, so the five recognized parties in statewide_by_party (546+30199+1741+212099+24931 = 269,516) sum to less than the total by the 2,304 'Other' registrants. All 23 counties present. All county row totals verified to equal the sum of their party columns; column totals verified to equal reported statewide totals; sum of county totals (271,820) matches the reported statewide TOTAL exactly."
